## 10. Caveats / known risks

Finding:

```text
This branch defines the native worker backend descriptor but does not integrate it into execute-action or executor behavior.
```

Affected surface:

```text
Future Capability Bus / Router / Service / Executor integration.
```

Why it matters:

```text
The canonical backend descriptor exists, but no runtime request will execute through it until a later behavior branch wires the execution path intentionally.
```

Smallest safe correction:

```text
Keep this branch contract-only. Pick execution placement during runtime-capability-bus-executor-skeleton-v1 or a dedicated nativeWorkerBackend execution integration branch.
```

What still needs verification:

```text
GitHub branch upload inspection and post-merge main inspection if merged.
```

